        "text": "So, if h is the height of the segment, then A = r² arccos((r - h)/r) - (r - h)√(2rh - h²).\n\nSo, in our case, r = 3 meters, and A = 4.5π m².\n\nSo, plugging in the values:\n\n4.5π = 3² arccos((3 - h)/3) - (3 - h)√(2*3*h - h²)\n\nSimplify:\n\n4.5π = 9 arccos((3 - h)/3) - (3 - h)√(6h - h²)"
